WEBVTT

00:03:28.934 --> 00:03:30.656
in favor of a new one, though,

00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:33.206
signals something awesome
about our adaptability.

00:03:33.656 --> 00:03:35.061
It's not fixed.

00:03:35.085 --> 00:03:38.252
Instead, each of us
has the capacity to improve it,

00:03:38.276 --> 00:03:40.688
through dedication and hard work.

00:03:40.712 --> 00:03:44.603
On the last page of Gandhi's
autobiography, he wrote,

00:03:44.627 --> 00:03:47.159
"I must reduce myself to zero."

00:03:47.903 --> 00:03:50.506
At many points in his very full life,

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:54.807
he was still seeking to return
to a beginner's mindset, to zero.

00:03:54.831 --> 00:03:56.220
To unlearn.

00:03:56.244 --> 00:03:59.077
In this way, I think
it's pretty safe to say

00:03:59.101 --> 00:04:00.949
Gandhi had a high AQ score.